{"Map-Title":"05: Apprehension","Map-Author":"Darkademic","Map-Categories-Mission":"Campaign","Map-Briefing":"A Nod base has been located off the coast, and there may be a connection to recent chrono disturbances.\n\nNod is using the cover of the base to evacuate local forces, as well as important cargo via transport boats.\n\nOur objective is to destroy their SAM sites so our bombers can take care of the rest. Once the base is neutralized, secure any remaining transports for analysis."}
